00:10:08.525 --> 00:10:10.061
- I like, I like to stay happy.

00:10:10.061 --> 00:10:13.726
And I like to live life light,
and make the best of life.

00:10:13.726 --> 00:10:15.932
And, I think that when you carry

00:10:15.932 --> 00:10:17.294
