00:10:20.167 --> 00:10:22.240
you just can't grow, and
you can't really, like, move

00:10:22.240 --> 00:10:23.226
how you need to.

00:10:23.226 --> 00:10:25.886
So, for me, I just like
to be happy and cool

00:10:25.886 --> 00:10:26.944
with pretty much everybody.

00:10:26.944 --> 00:10:27.777
- [Interviewer] Right.

00:10:27.777 --> 00:10:29.525
- You know, and that's
just pretty much it.

00:10:29.525 --> 00:10:31.191
But I've always believed in myself.

00:10:31.191 --> 00:10:32.782
You know, I've always been a big dreamer,

00:10:32.782 --> 00:10:35.118
